# Using

Using is a statement used in a script, usually at the top of the file. It will import other aql script files into the current namespace; all DECLARE and common table expression will be availble. Circular references will be ignored.

---

## Basic Syntax

USING <file>

---

## Examples

```text
USING "file.aql"
```
<file> = "file.aql"

The <file> ALWAYS needs quotes and AQL will look from the current directory for the <file>.